mple private space-pilot in the service of the Federation. Well.. the word \u201cpilot\u201d might be an overstatement. John\u2019s ship AI \u2013 which he calls \u201cEllie\u201d - takes almost all control of the ship. The space battles are coordinated by Motherships and \u201cpilots\u201d serve the mere role of the shooters (as the AI can\u2019t \u2018kill\u2019).<br><br>IGC is about to turn the tide of the war but an accident happens. Your Mothership is blown up into pieces which makes Ellie go crazy. It puts John into hibernation and wakes him up several years later in a completely different setting. What really happened? What is the AI up to?<br>Will the two - John and Ellie - change the fate of the Universe?<br><br>Experience fast action, thrilling levels, spectacular explosions and lots of pew-pew-pew. Star Horizon is a reboot for the on-rails space shooter genre.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/352960/extras/15129649b5741e0794814dc7430bdcc0.poster.avif?t=1589561762\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/352960/extras/15129649b5741e0794814dc7430bdcc0.webm?t=1589561762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/352960/extras/15129649b5741e0794814dc7430bdcc0.mp4?t=1589561762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
